<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Oilfields first half profit up.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Oilfields first half profit up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees):</p>
<p>    Sales		  934 vs 380</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     420 vs  35</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    331 vs  14 million loss</p>
<p>    Interim div     15 pct vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Pakistan Oilfields Ltd. The firm, which is engaged in oil and gas exploration, carried forward 2,010 million to the balance sheet. Book closure March 20-30. Ex-dividend date March 20. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
